.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-rm 1  "quarters-rm " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-rm \- Remove an inactive space after exact\-name confirmation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-rm\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-confirm\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove an inactive space after exact\-name confirmation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Must exactly repeat the space name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Space to remove
